Description: Roland OCTA-CAPTURE driver and graphical control panel
 Standalone ALSA USB audio/MIDI driver and GTK4/HTML control panel for the
 Roland OCTA-CAPTURE UA-1010. Includes a private ALSA source snapshot for
 Linux 6.12; DKMS builds the external module without rebuilding the kernel.
 Installs device-specific hotplug activation, desktop integration and a
 regular-user PulseAudio stereo-pair service.
